                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-kerbalspaceprogram-squad-s2-1200x1600-8c341b1b07e0.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Squad",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "The Kerbal Company",
                    "description": "Kerbal Space Program features three gameplay modes. In Science Mode, perform space experiments to unlock new technology and advance the knowledge of Kerbalkind. In Career Mode, oversee every aspect of the space program, including construction, strategy, funding, upgrades, and more. In Sandbox, you are free to build any spacecraft you can think of, with all parts and technology in the game. \n\n# Key Features\n\n- Take full control over your ship’s setup to execute complex flight maneuvers. \n- Manage your Kerbal crewmembers, including hiring, training, and sending them into space to become heroes. \n-  Discover a whole star system with unique moons and planets, exploring detailed terrain at a vast scale. \n- Send your Kerbal crew outside their ships for “extra-vehicular” activities.\n- Dock spacecraft together to construct space stations, massive starships, and surface bases on new planets. \n- Use satellites to scan terrain and find biomes and other anomalies.\n- Set up communications networks to communicate between your spacecraft and Kerbal Space Center.\n- Research and develop new technologies to extract valuable information and resources from all over the solar system, and much more!",
                    "shortDescription": "In Kerbal Space Program, take charge of the space program for the alien race known as the Kerbals. You have access to an array of parts to assemble fully-functional spacecraft that flies (or doesn’t) based on realistic aerodynamic and orbital physics.",
                    "title": "Kerbal Space Program",
                    "developerLogo": {
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    }
                },
